     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>What is 38% of 600?</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"n\"></span> percent, denoted <span data-math=\"n\\% \"></span>, is the fraction <span data-math=\"\\frac{n}{{100}}.\"></span></p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Rewrite “of” as multiplication.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{38}}{{100}} \\times 600\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Use your calculator.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"228\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
